# "If you control an outlaw" (CR 700.12a): only Bot1's own permanents count. Bot2 controls the Faerie Miscreant (a Faerie Rogue, so
# an outlaw), Bot1 controls none, so Take the Fall on that very Miscreant gives it -1/-0 only: a 0/1, not -3/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Take the Fall
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Faerie Miscreant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Faerie Miscreant.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Take the Fall.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Faerie Miscreant)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Faerie Miscreant.Power = 0

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Faerie Miscreant.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Faerie Miscreant.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Take the Fall
